\@writefile{toc}{\contentsline {subsection}{\numberline {2.3}Run configurations}{2}{subsection.2.3}\protected@file@percent }
\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Configurations and datasets. Later sections report A--C in full on Qwen3-14B, then G--H (14B), E--F (8B), and I--J (DeepSeek-R1 8B) on the seven-file math suite (APC vs.\ ForkServe only), then K (ForkServe+ concurrency from those peaks) and L (prefill-method comparison). On D, recompute and APC are complete; ForkServe on the full Game24 and HumanEval files is in progress.}}{2}{table.caption.4}\protected@file@percent }
